{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"UndirectedIncidenceList"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The vertices are any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" values, kept in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrderedSet"},{"type":"text","text":" whose element "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":" is vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"i"},{"type":"text","text":": the vertices listed first, then new members by first appearance. A hyperedge is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"set of vertices of any size, the empty set included; repeated hyperedges are kept, each at its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own position "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<hyperedgeCount"},{"type":"text","text":", and a member listed twice is stored once. Members are stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in vertex-index order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storage is compressed sparse rows: the members of every hyperedge in one array, and for every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex its incidence numbers and, beside them, its hyperedge positions, in rows of shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pools. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"memberIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidentHyperedges(ofIndex:)"},{"type":"text","text":" are stored "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ArraySlice<Int>"},{"type":"text","text":" rows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read without hashing, and the hypergraph makes a constant number of allocations however many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices it has. Every vertex-space read hashes its vertex once; index-space reads and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hypergraphs"},{"type":"text","text":" algorithms hash none."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Hyperedges can be appended but not removed. Equality ignores the order of the vertices and of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the hyperedges.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps from the vertices and the hyperedges to values can be attached (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PropertyGraph"},{"text":"): a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex map is read by vertex index or by vertex, an edge map by hyperedge position.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Hypergraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/PropertyGraph","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s28CustomDebugStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/Se","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SE","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SQ","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/SH","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}]